# English translation table for Fetchora - engine / backend layer.
#
# One entry per line:   <Simplified Chinese source> => <English>
# Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored.
# Apply with:  powershell -File tools\make-translations.ps1
#
# Covers exactly the strings owned by the Aria2Manager, TorrentUtils,
# Aria2Process and QObject contexts: toast / notification / InfoBar messages,
# the aria2 error-code table, and the status words those contexts share.
#
# NOTE: the whole task-status family (下载中, 等待中, 已暂停, 已完成, 失败, 已移除,
# 未知错误) is shared with Theme.qml and FluentTaskList only - this map does not
# own it, and en.shell.map already carries the same wording for those contexts.

# ------------------------------------------------- aria2 error-code descriptions
# Shown in the task-details "error" row and in notifications. Short labels, no
# full stop, Windows-consistent wording. Codes 1-32, see aria2ErrorMessage().
超时 => Timed out
资源未找到 => Resource not found
“未找到”响应过多 => Too many "not found" responses
下载速度过慢 => Download speed too slow
网络问题 => Network problem
仍有未完成的下载 => Downloads still in progress
远端服务器不支持断点续传 => Remote server does not support resuming
磁盘空间不足 => Not enough disk space
分片长度与控制文件不一致 => Piece length does not match the control file
重复任务：该文件已在下载 => Duplicate task: this file is already downloading
重复任务：该种子已在下载 => Duplicate task: this torrent is already downloading
文件已存在 => File already exists
重命名失败：文件已存在 => Rename failed: the file already exists
无法打开已存在的文件 => Could not open the existing file
无法创建新文件或删除旧文件 => Could not create a new file or delete the old one
文件系统错误 => File system error
无法创建目录 => Could not create the directory
域名解析失败 => Could not resolve the host name
无法解析 Metalink 文档 => Could not parse the Metalink document
FTP 命令失败 => FTP command failed
HTTP 响应头异常 => Unexpected HTTP response header
重定向次数过多 => Too many redirects
HTTP 认证失败 => HTTP authentication failed
无法解析 bencode 文件 => Could not parse the bencode file
种子文件已损坏或缺少信息 => The torrent file is corrupt or incomplete
磁力链接格式错误 => Invalid Magnet link
选项错误或不被支持 => Invalid or unsupported option
远端服务器暂时无法处理该请求 => Remote server cannot handle the request right now
无法解析 JSON-RPC 请求 => Could not parse the JSON-RPC request
保留项，已忽略 => Reserved code, ignored
校验和不匹配 => Checksum mismatch
错误 %1 => Error %1

# --------------------------------------------------- notifications (titles)
# Notification titles - the file name (and error text) follows on the next line,
# so these stay short and take no full stop.
下载完成 => Download complete
下载失败 => Download failed
下载已开始 => Download started

# ----------------------------------------------------------------- engine toasts
引擎错误 => Engine error
引擎未运行，正在重启（第 %1 次）。 => The engine is not running. Restarting (attempt %1).
aria2c 已崩溃。 => aria2c crashed.
aria2c 未及时响应。 => aria2c did not respond in time.
无法向 aria2c 写入数据。 => Could not write to aria2c.
无法从 aria2c 读取数据。 => Could not read from aria2c.
未知的 aria2c 进程错误。 => Unknown aria2c process error.
未找到 aria2c，请将其放在程序目录下或加入 PATH。 => aria2c was not found. Put it next to the program or add it to PATH.
启动 aria2c 失败（%1）。 => Could not start aria2c (%1).
已连接到 aria2 %1。 => Connected to aria2 %1.
无法应用运行时选项：%1 => Could not apply the runtime options: %1
已应用引擎选项。 => Engine options applied.
会话已保存。 => Session saved.
浏览器桥接端口 %1 无法绑定：%2 => Could not bind the browser bridge port %1: %2
浏览器请求失败：%1 => Browser request failed: %1
浏览器批量添加失败：%1 => Could not add the browser batch: %1
已从浏览器添加：%1 => Added from the browser: %1
已从浏览器添加 %1 个下载任务。 => Added %1 downloads from the browser.
未提供链接。 => No link provided.
无法添加 %1：%2 => Could not add %1: %2
已添加：%1 => Added: %1
无法读取种子文件：%1 => Could not read the torrent file: %1
无法添加种子：%1 => Could not add the torrent: %1
已添加种子：%1 => Torrent added: %1
无法读取 Metalink 文件：%1 => Could not read the Metalink file: %1
无法添加 Metalink：%1 => Could not add the Metalink: %1
无法添加磁力链接：%1 => Could not add the Magnet link: %1
尚未找到文件。 => File not found yet.
无法自动重试该种子，请重新添加种子文件或磁力链接。 => Could not retry this torrent automatically. Add the torrent file or Magnet link again.
该任务没有可用于重试的源地址。 => This task has no source address to retry from.
任务选项已更新。 => Task options updated.
尚未获取信息哈希，请等待元数据下载完成。 => The info hash is not available yet. Wait for the metadata download to finish.
已添加 Tracker。 => Tracker added.
已移除 Tracker。 => Tracker removed.
已暂停全部下载。 => All downloads paused.
已开始全部下载。 => All downloads resumed.
已清除完成记录。 => Finished records cleared.

# ------------------------------------------ aria2c startup / engine restart logs
Restarting aria2 with the current settings… => Restarting aria2 with the current settings…
aria2c rejected the option "%1". Clear it in Settings → Advanced, or reset the extra arguments. => aria2c rejected the option "%1". Clear it in Settings → Advanced, or reset the extra arguments.

# ------------------------------------------------------------ torrent creation
正在索引… %1 个文件 => Indexing… %1 files
校验中… %1% => Verifying… %1%
正在校验 %1 个文件（%2） => Verifying %1 files (%2)
种子已生成。 => Torrent created.
源路径不存在：%1 => Source path does not exist: %1
未指定输出路径。 => No output path specified.
没有可分享的内容：源路径中没有文件。 => Nothing to share: the source path has no files.
无法读取 %1 => Could not read %1
无法写入 %1 => Could not write %1
无法打开 %1 => Could not open %1
不是有效的种子文件。 => Not a valid torrent file.
缺少 info 字典。 => The info dictionary is missing.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- status word
BitTorrent => BitTorrent
